    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύ̆σ-βᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to traverse,
				impassable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαχανίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					432c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσχωρίαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.27
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ μακρὰ
			διερμήνευσις</span> lamb.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Myst.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>trodden in sorrow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περσὶς αἶα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1069
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
